155
00:25:09,454 --> 00:25:11,154
ちゃんと見えているよ！
I can see you all clearly!

156
00:25:12,454 --> 00:25:13,654
そして！
And next!

157
00:25:14,154 --> 00:25:16,354
えー、いつものやつやろっかな？
Let's see, shall we do the usual thing?

158
00:25:16,704 --> 00:25:19,154
アリーナ席！
Arena seats!

159
00:25:22,304 --> 00:25:24,554
2階席！
Second-floor seats!

160
00:25:27,154 --> 00:25:29,354
3階席！
Third-floor seats!

161
00:25:31,254 --> 00:25:33,554
4階席！
Fourth-floor seats!

162
00:25:34,954 --> 00:25:36,554
おおー！そして！
Ooh! And next!

163
00:25:37,304 --> 00:25:38,304
そうだな…
Let's see...

164
00:25:38,454 --> 00:25:40,754
女の子！
Girls!

165
00:25:42,254 --> 00:25:44,454
うおお！ありがとう！
Whoa! Thank you!

166
00:25:44,954 --> 00:25:49,054
えーっと、海外ニキネキ！
Um, overseas bros and sis!

167
00:25:51,354 --> 00:25:52,754
ありがとう！
Thank you!

168
00:25:53,204 --> 00:25:55,154
あとは何がいいかな…あ！
What else should I call out... Oh!

169
00:25:55,204 --> 00:25:57,754
今回初めて来た人！
Anyone here for the first time today!

170
00:26:00,154 --> 00:26:02,104
いや、みんな初めてになってる…
Wait, that makes it everyone's first time...

171
00:26:02,154 --> 00:26:05,854
あ、じゃあ、そらちのライブ初体験の人！
Oh, then, anyone experiencing Sora-chi's live concert for the very first time!

172
00:26:07,054 --> 00:26:08,804
結構多いってことね！
So that's quite a lot of you!

173
00:26:08,954 --> 00:26:11,304
今までも来てるよって人！
Anyone who's been coming before too!

174
00:26:12,504 --> 00:26:15,354
お！ありがとうございます！
Oh! Thank you very much!

175
00:26:15,554 --> 00:26:20,954
すごいですね、いろんな人が集まっているこのライブ、素晴らしいよ！わーい！
It's amazing, this concert with all kinds of people gathered here is wonderful! Yay!

176
00:26:22,504 --> 00:26:24,504
飲み物飲みます
I'm going to take a drink.

177
00:26:41,854 --> 00:26:43,054
配信…
The stream...

178
00:26:46,054 --> 00:26:50,054
というわけで、なんと…
And with that, believe it or not...

179
00:26:50,654 --> 00:26:54,054
無料配信は、YouTubeの…
The free stream on YouTube...

180
00:26:54,854 --> 00:26:59,354
ここまでとなります！
Ends right here!

181
00:27:00,554 --> 00:27:03,054
えー、今来たばっかり？
Aww, you just got here?

182
00:27:03,254 --> 00:27:08,154
続きは概要欄を見てください！うわーい！
Please check the description for the rest! Yay!

183
00:27:11,954 --> 00:27:17,854
それでは、次の曲行ってみようか！盛り上がってくよー！
Well then, let's head into the next song! Let's get hyped!

184
